WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:04.219
Ringo and Bot walked to the gym.

2
00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:09.719
Ringo groaned. "I hope we don't see Lucy."

3
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.632
"Me too," Bot said.

4
00:00:12.633 --> 00:00:16.928
"She's always singing!"

5
00:00:16.929 --> 00:00:21.199
Lucy wanted to win a contest.

6
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.276
It was the Best Voice in the Galaxy.

7
00:00:25.277 --> 00:00:32.437
She was practicing a lot.

8
00:00:32.438 --> 00:00:37.165
But her voice was not very good.

9
00:00:37.166 --> 00:00:40.808
Ringo opened the door.

10
00:00:40.809 --> 00:00:43.202
"Ugh," he thought.

11
00:00:43.203 --> 00:00:46.887
Lucy was running on a machine.

12
00:00:46.888 --> 00:00:56.343
"Hi, Ringo!" Lucy sang.

13
00:00:56.344 --> 00:00:59.168
"I think my voice is getting better.

14
00:00:59.169 --> 00:01:00.610
What do you think?

15
00:01:00.611 --> 00:01:03.653
La, la, la, la!"

16
00:01:03.654 --> 00:01:07.342
"Um . . ." Ringo bit his lip.

17
00:01:07.343 --> 00:01:13.005
He didn't want to be mean.

18
00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:15.400
But he was sick of her singing.

19
00:01:15.401 --> 00:01:27.506
"It sounds great!" he said.

20
00:01:27.507 --> 00:01:31.005
Ringo started running on a machine.

21
00:01:31.006 --> 00:01:35.646
Lucy grinned. "I'll win and be super famous.

22
00:01:35.647 --> 00:01:39.052
Just like Diva!"

23
00:01:39.053 --> 00:01:45.455
Ringo frowned as Lucy sang loudly.

24
00:01:45.456 --> 00:01:48.576
Captain Nova flashed on Ringo's screen.

25
00:01:48.577 --> 00:01:52.993
"Ringo!" she said. "Come to my office."

26
00:01:52.994 --> 00:01:56.110
"I'll be right there!" Ringo said.

27
00:01:56.111 --> 00:02:02.250
"La, la, la!" Lucy sang.

28
00:02:02.251 --> 00:02:06.745
Captain Nova frowned. "I hear Lucy.

29
00:02:06.746 --> 00:02:09.790
Bring her with you."

30
00:02:09.791 --> 00:02:12.884
Ringo sighed.

31
00:02:12.885 --> 00:02:17.825
"Come on, Tiny!" Lucy sang.

32
00:02:17.826 --> 00:02:22.930
"Let's go!"

